# Sample requests. In Rider, click the green ▶ next to a request (the API must be running).
@api = http://localhost:5140

### Places, filtered and paged (names in Turkish by default)
GET {{api}}/api/places?type=Museum&page=1&pageSize=5

### Same list in English
GET {{api}}/api/places?unesco=true
Accept-Language: en

### Search by name, Turkish or English
GET {{api}}/api/places?search=efes

### One place with its description
GET {{api}}/api/places/ephesus
Accept-Language: en

### The 5 places nearest to Kızılay, Ankara
GET {{api}}/api/places/nearby?latitude=39.9208&longitude=32.8541&limit=5

### Places within 50 km of Ephesus (circular buffer)
GET {{api}}/api/places/nearby?latitude=37.9395&longitude=27.3417&radiusKm=50

### Places inside a polygon drawn around Antalya (point-in-polygon)
POST {{api}}/api/places/within
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geometry": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[[30.4, 36.7], [31.5, 36.7], [31.5, 37.1], [30.4, 37.1], [30.4, 36.7]]]
  }
}

### Places within 15 km of a line along the Lycian coast (buffer around a line)
POST {{api}}/api/places/within
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "geometry": { "type": "LineString", "coordinates": [[29.0, 36.3], [30.6, 36.3]] },
  "bufferKm": 15
}

### All places as GeoJSON (open the response in geojson.io to see them on a map)
GET {{api}}/api/places/geojson

### Provinces with the number of places inside each border
GET {{api}}/api/provinces

### Places inside İzmir's border
GET {{api}}/api/provinces/35/places

### Province borders as GeoJSON, simplified
GET {{api}}/api/provinces/geojson?toleranceDegrees=0.01

### Validation error: radius too large → 400 problem details
GET {{api}}/api/places/nearby?latitude=39.92&longitude=32.85&radiusKm=1000
